        <mxCell id="rel-cctv-clips-events" edge="1" parent="1" source="cctv_event_clips" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;endArrow=ERone;startArrow=ERmany;startSize=12;endSize=12;" target="access_events">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cctv-access-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#FCA5A5;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;CCTV ↔ Access Integration (migration 000013, cctv-svc plugin)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;padding:6px;font-size:10px;color:#374151&#39;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Camera is a device&lt;/b&gt;: cameras.device_id is both PK and FK to dm3_devices.devices (type=&#39;camera&#39;). Name, tenant, status, last_seen live on the base device row.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Access-point binding&lt;/b&gt;: cameras attach to access_points via existing dm3_access.access_devices junction — no new cross-plugin link table. UI queries access-points-all when configuring cameras.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Clip↔event correlation&lt;/b&gt;: event_clips.access_event_id is a soft FK (UUID, no hard constraint) into dm3_access.access_events. Access-history pages query GET /api/v1/cctv/clips?access_event_id=… to surface footage.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Event-driven clip trigger&lt;/b&gt;: access-svc publishes access events to NATS; cctv-svc consumes + creates clips asynchronously (trigger=&#39;access_event&#39;). No direct service-to-service call — decoupled via NATS.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Storage&lt;/b&gt;: clip blobs in MinIO (presigned URLs); metadata in TimescaleDB hypertable (7-day chunks, retention worker prunes per cctv_settings.retention_days).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Credentials&lt;/b&gt;: RTSP password encrypted in Go (AES-GCM, env key) — pgcrypto intentionally not enabled.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="1010" x="1580" y="4060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="access_devices" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#3B82F6&#39;&gt;access_devices&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;Physical device under an access point&lt;br/&gt;(reader, barrier, turnstile…)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 access_point_id → access_points CASCADE&lt;br/&gt;🔗 device_id → dm3_devices.devices (soft)&lt;br/&gt;type : VARCHAR(30) CHECK(reader|barrier|turnstile|…)&lt;br/&gt;direction : VARCHAR(10) (in|out|both)&lt;br/&gt;name : VARCHAR(255)&lt;br/&gt;source : VARCHAR(30) def &#39;manual&#39;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;(manual | parking | cctv — auto-register origin, migration 011)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;source_ref : VARCHAR(100)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;(e.g. parking_zone_id for barrier auto-sync)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;config : JSONB def &#39;{}&#39;&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="240" x="1050" y="1010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="access_point_devices" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#3B82F6&#39;&gt;access_point_devices&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;legacy junction: AP ↔ dm3_devices.devices&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 (access_point_id, device_id) PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 access_point_id → access_points CASCADE&lt;br/&gt;🔗 device_id → dm3_devices.devices CASCADE&lt;br/&gt;direction : VARCHAR(10)&lt;br/&gt;created_at&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="240" x="1130" y="1390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sync_meta" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#8B5CF6&#39;&gt;sync_meta&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;last-sync cursor for device provisioning/pull&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;entity_type : VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;last_synced_at : TIMESTAMPTZ&lt;br/&gt;last_synced_id : UUID&lt;br/&gt;metadata : JSONB def &#39;{}&#39;&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, entity_type)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="220" x="1110" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-ap-accessdevices" edge="1" parent="1" source="access_points" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#3B82F6;endArrow=ERmany;startArrow=ERone;startSize=12;endSize=12;" target="access_devices">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-accessdevices-devices" edge="1" parent="1" source="access_devices" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;endArrow=ERone;startArrow=ERmany;startSize=12;endSize=12;" target="devices">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
