        <mxCell id="attendance-label" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#D97706;" value="dm3_attendance  (plugin-gated: RequirePlugin(&quot;attendance&quot;))" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="400" x="55" y="3618" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_shifts" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;shifts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;site_id : UUID (root-zone = site)&lt;br/&gt;name : VARCHAR(100)&lt;br/&gt;code : VARCHAR(20)&lt;br/&gt;start_time / end_time : TIME&lt;br/&gt;grace_period_minutes : INT def 15&lt;br/&gt;early_leave_threshold : INT def 15&lt;br/&gt;break_start / break_end : TIME&lt;br/&gt;break_deducted : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;overtime_threshold_minutes : INT def 30&lt;br/&gt;max_overtime_hours : NUM(3,1) def 4.0&lt;br/&gt;working_days : INT[] def {1..5}&lt;br/&gt;color : VARCHAR(7) def #3B82F6&lt;br/&gt;is_default : BOOL def false&lt;br/&gt;status : CHECK(active|archived)&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id) WHERE is_default AND status=active&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="260" x="60" y="3660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_shift_assignments" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;shift_assignments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;user ↔ shift with effective window&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 user_id → dm3_identity.users (soft)&lt;br/&gt;🔗 shift_id → shifts CASCADE&lt;br/&gt;effective_from : DATE NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;effective_until : DATE&lt;br/&gt;created_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;CHECK effective_until ≥ effective_from&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="260" x="60" y="4040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_records" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;attendance_records&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;TimescaleDB hypertable (chunk 1 month on date)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 (tenant_id, date, user_id, id) PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 user_id → dm3_identity.users (soft)&lt;br/&gt;site_id : UUID&lt;br/&gt;date : DATE (partition key)&lt;br/&gt;🔗 shift_id → shifts SET NULL&lt;br/&gt;clock_in / clock_out : TIMESTAMPTZ&lt;br/&gt;clock_in_device_id / clock_out_device_id : UUID&lt;br/&gt;clock_in_method / clock_out_method : VARCHAR(30)&lt;br/&gt;clock_in_photo_ref / clock_out_photo_ref&lt;br/&gt;status : CHECK(pending|on_time|late|absent|&lt;br/&gt;  &amp;nbsp;on_leave|half_day|holiday)&lt;br/&gt;total_hours / regular_hours / overtime_hours&lt;br/&gt;late_minutes / early_leave_minutes : INT&lt;br/&gt;break_minutes : INT&lt;br/&gt;overtime_approved : BOOL · overtime_approved_by : UUID&lt;br/&gt;overtime_review_note : TEXT&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;(reviewer comment on OT approve/reject, migration 034)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;manual_adjustment : BOOL · adjusted_by : UUID&lt;br/&gt;adjustment_reason : TEXT&lt;br/&gt;leave_type : VARCHAR(30)&lt;br/&gt;leave_reference_id : VARCHAR(50)&lt;br/&gt;notes : TEXT&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, user_id, date)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="540" width="260" x="60" y="4260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_devices" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;attendance_devices&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;allowlist: which readers count as clock signals&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;site_id : UUID&lt;br/&gt;🔗 device_id → dm3_devices.devices (soft)&lt;br/&gt;function : CHECK(clock_in|clock_out|both)&lt;br/&gt;location_name : VARCHAR(200)&lt;br/&gt;is_primary : BOOL def false&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, device_id)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="260" x="340" y="3660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_holidays" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;holidays&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;tenant holiday calendar (migration 031)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;date : DATE NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;name : VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;description : TEXT&lt;br/&gt;is_paid : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, date)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="260" x="340" y="3900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_settings" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;attendance_settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;one row per tenant (lazy-created)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 tenant_id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;default_grace_minutes : INT def 15&lt;br/&gt;default_early_leave_threshold : INT def 15&lt;br/&gt;overtime_threshold_minutes : INT def 30&lt;br/&gt;overtime_requires_approval : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;auto_clockout_hours : INT def 12&lt;br/&gt;workweek_start : INT def 1 (1=Mon..7=Sun)&lt;br/&gt;timezone : VARCHAR(64) def &#39;UTC&#39;&lt;br/&gt;carryover_enabled : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;carryover_max_days : NUM(5,2) def 5&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="260" x="340" y="4120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_summary" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;attendance_summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;monthly rollup (migration 032) — populated by cron&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 user_id → dm3_identity.users (soft)&lt;br/&gt;year : INT (2000..2100)&lt;br/&gt;month : INT (1..12)&lt;br/&gt;workdays / on_time_count / late_count : INT&lt;br/&gt;absent_count / on_leave_count / half_day_count&lt;br/&gt;holiday_count / pending_count : INT&lt;br/&gt;total_hours / regular_hours / overtime_hours&lt;br/&gt;approved_overtime_hours : NUM(10,2)&lt;br/&gt;late_minutes / early_leave_minutes : INT&lt;br/&gt;generated_at : TIMESTAMPTZ&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, user_id, year, month)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="340" width="260" x="340" y="4400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_leave_policies" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;leave_policies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;annual · sick · unpaid · …&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;code : VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;name : VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;color : VARCHAR(7) def #3B82F6&lt;br/&gt;annual_quota_days : NUM(5,2) def 0&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;(0 = unlimited / unpaid)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;requires_approval : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;deducts_attendance : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;paid : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;is_active : BOOL def true&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, code)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="260" x="620" y="3660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_leave_balances" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;leave_balances&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;per-user/policy yearly accrual + usage&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 user_id → dm3_identity.users (soft)&lt;br/&gt;🔗 policy_id → leave_policies CASCADE&lt;br/&gt;year : INT NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;entitled_days / used_days : NUM(5,2)&lt;br/&gt;pending_days / carried_over : NUM(5,2)&lt;br/&gt;updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, user_id, policy_id, year)&lt;br/&gt;arithmetic inside Serializable tx&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="260" x="620" y="3970" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="att_leave_requests" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#D97706&#39;&gt;leave_requests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8&#39;&gt;pending → approved | rejected | cancelled&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr size=&#39;1&#39;/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:11px;padding:4px&#39;&gt;🔑 id : UUID PK&lt;br/&gt;🔗 tenant_id → tenants&lt;br/&gt;🔗 user_id → dm3_identity.users (soft)&lt;br/&gt;🔗 policy_id → leave_policies RESTRICT&lt;br/&gt;start_date / end_date : DATE&lt;br/&gt;days : NUM(5,2) NOT NULL&lt;br/&gt;half_day : BOOL def false&lt;br/&gt;reason : TEXT&lt;br/&gt;attachment_ref : VARCHAR(255)&lt;br/&gt;status : CHECK(pending|approved|rejected|cancelled)&lt;br/&gt;reviewed_by : UUID · reviewed_at : TZ&lt;br/&gt;review_note : TEXT&lt;br/&gt;cancelled_at : TZ&lt;br/&gt;external_id : VARCHAR(128)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;(HR-sync idempotency key, migration 033)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;created_at / updated_at&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;⚡ UNIQUE(tenant_id, external_id) partial&lt;br/&gt;CHECK end_date ≥ start_date&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="260" x="620" y="4230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="attendance-access-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FCD34D;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Attendance ↔ Access Integration (migrations 029–033, attend-svc port 8010)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;padding:6px;font-size:10px;color:#374151&#39;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Clock signals come from access events&lt;/b&gt;: attend-svc consumes the access-svc NATS stream (DEVICES / subject &lt;code&gt;dm3.access.events.{tenant}&lt;/code&gt;). There is no dedicated attendance device API — a reader is &amp;quot;attendance-capable&amp;quot; only if it is registered in &lt;b&gt;attendance_devices&lt;/b&gt; for that tenant.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Consumer allowlist&lt;/b&gt;: consumer.go gates every event on &lt;code&gt;attendance_devices&lt;/code&gt; — unregistered devices (e.g. parking barriers, perimeter readers) are silently dropped so they never manufacture clock-in records.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Soft cross-schema refs&lt;/b&gt;: user_id, device_id, site_id are plain UUIDs — no hard FK across schemas. Application layer enforces integrity (see tenant/middleware.go ValidateResourceAccess).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Site = root zone&lt;/b&gt;: DM3 core has no sites table, so site_id on shifts / attendance_records points at a root zone id resolved during consumption.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Rollup pipeline&lt;/b&gt;: hourly cron (with panic recover) materialises status (BR-004 absence marking) and maintains attendance_summary for fast reports.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Audit trail&lt;/b&gt;: every mutating handler publishes &lt;code&gt;attendance.*&lt;/code&gt; entries to dm3_audit via pkg/audit.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="1000" x="60" y="4780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-att-assign-shifts" edge="1" parent="1" source="att_shift_assignments" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#D97706;endArrow=ERone;startArrow=ERmany;startSize=12;endSize=12;" target="att_shifts">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-att-records-shifts" edge="1" parent="1" source="att_records" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#D97706;endArrow=ERone;startArrow=ERmany;startSize=12;endSize=12;" target="att_shifts">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-att-records-users" edge="1" parent="1" source="att_records" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;endArrow=ERone;startArrow=ERmany;startSize=12;endSize=12;" target="identity_users">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
